Z||000005||bHooper||03-05-2001||10:50 PM||||well i started installing the new headliner at 6 pm, and with a 30 min break for dinner, i'm through!... doing headliners!<P>what a pain in the arse!  getting those stupid visor's back in and those silly curve's for the sunroof... i never thought i would say, what i'm about to say... but boy, am i glad i don't have t-tops!<P>next time, the pro's can do it!<P>but for $25, i guess i really shouldnt complain.<P>hoop||||reg||1
Z||000006||DXR_DAD||03-05-2001||11:21 PM||||Good job Hoop!  what's wrong, you don't like a little WORK!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Your right for $25 and your time it's worth it. I've done 2 so far and I'm happy I did.<P>DXR_DAD||||reg||14
